REMARK 300 REMARK: CHAIN M AND N SEEM TO BE ABNORMAL MONOMER SOD1. SOME OF THE  
REMARK 300 SOD1 PROTEINS SEEM TO BE PARTIALLY DISORDERED, AND CANNOT MAKE A     
REMARK 300 DIMER IN THE SOLUBLE STATE. THE CHAIN M OR N IS A PARTIALLY          
REMARK 300 DISORDERED PROTEIN AND ATTACHED TO THE NORMAL PROTEIN COMPLEXES. AS  
REMARK 300 A RESULT, THEY HAVE WEAK AND DIFFUSED ELECTRON DENSITY MAPS AND      
REMARK 300 THEY DON'T HAVE DIMERIC PARTNERS.                                    
